From a395bee465a9efd3e7ea3774445c8f98e317fcbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AnyPS5 contributors <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Reserve signaled kernel semaphore tokens for queued waiters

Backport upstream AnyPS5 #9491, retaining the pinned base's attribute validation and unsupported 0x100 handling. Reserve tokens under the semaphore lock in FIFO or guest-priority order so polling threads cannot steal signaled tokens before awakened workers run. Include upstream handoff tests and trace test stubs.

